se":"David","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"David::David::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"David"},"text":"David brought out the people who were there and put them to work with saws, iron picks, and axes. And he did the same to all the Ammonite cities. Then David and all his troops returned to Jerusalem.","verse":3},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"David","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"David::David::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"David"},"text":"and when he taunted Israel, Jonathan the son of David’s brother Shimei killed him.","verse":7},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"David","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"David::David::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"David"},"text":"So these descendants of Rapha in Gath fell at the hands of David and his servants.","verse":8}],"id":"David","label":"David","matchReviews":[{"ruleId":"David::David::reviewed_unambiguous_name","scope":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","senseReview":"Reviewed complete original name headword and source subject. Article covers the biblical person(s), named place, or named spiritual figure denoted by this exact spelling; multiple persons under one unchanged source article remain together. Actual proper-name capitalization and whole-name boundaries required. Explicit occurrence-level ambiguity exclusions override this rule.","sourceHeadwordId":"David","term":"David"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"David","sourceTitle":"David"},{"evidence":[{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Jair","senseEvidence":{"basis":"source_verse_citation","originalCitations":[{"anchorIndex":7,"href":"?bref=1Chr.20.5","rawReference":"1Chr.20.5"}],"ruleId":"Jair::Jair::source_verse_citation","sourceHeadword